#5801
Central Chamber within the Adventurer's Academy~
   Paintings of mighty heroes locked in battle with the forces of evil
cover the walls of this great chamber, and between them hang faded
tapestries and candles that flicker in iron sconces.  Long benches face
a raised lectern where veterans once taught the young, and where one old
teacher still does.  In the north wall an old doorway has been bricked
up, but a pale shimmer hangs across the bricks, like heat above a road
in summer: the way into the Proving Halls, for anyone the master judges
ready.  Steps lead out and down through a gateway to the south, onto the
streets of Elrhinn.
~
