#5802
The First Room~
   You hear a noise behind you and turn around to find the way you came
gone: a stone wall that looks as though it has always been there stands
where the shimmer was.  This is the first of the Academy's Proving
Halls, built long ago to teach young adventurers the lessons they would
need to survive.  Words have been painted on the wall in neat white
letters.  To the north, a doorway leads to another room.
~
