#5811
The Edge of the Jungle~
   The jungle closes in around you the moment you leave the beach.  Hot,
wet air settles on your skin like a blanket, and the light turns green
and dim under the canopy.  Creepers hang everywhere, and somewhere close
by something large crashes away through the undergrowth.  A muddy path
leads east into the jungle and south into a swamp, and the beach lies
west.
