#5812
A Jungle Trail~
   A trail has been hacked through the jungle here by heavy blades, and
the stumps of the cut vines still ooze sap.  Huge hoofprints are pressed
deep into the mud.  The trees here are so tall that their crowns are
lost in the green gloom far above.  The trail runs east and west, a fig
grove lies north, and a dark hollow opens to the south.
