The Strangler Fig Grove~
   Great strangler figs grow here, their pale roots wrapped around the
dead trunks of the trees they have killed, so that each one stands like
a cage around a hollow where a tree used to be.  Ropes of roots hang
down from the canopy, and one of the hollow figs is so big that you
could climb up inside it.  Paths lead east and south.
