#5815
The Overgrown Shrine of Karras~
   The ruin of an old shrine stands here, almost swallowed by the
jungle.  Its pillars are wrapped in creepers and its roof has fallen in,
but the great stone statue at its heart still stands: a minotaur of
enormous size, its horns broken, holding a double-bladed axe across its
chest.  Offerings of fruit and flowers have been laid at its hooves,
some of them fresh.  Paths lead south and west.
