#5817
In the Jungle Canopy~
   You have climbed up through the hollow fig into the canopy, a second
world of branches, flowers and sunlight high above the jungle floor.
Monkeys chatter in the treetops, and from up here you can see the whole
isle: the black beach, the steaming jungle, and to the east a great
fortress of gray stone rising on a rocky hill.  The hollow trunk leads
back down.
