The Gatehouse~
   You stand in the vaulted gatehouse of Karras, between the outer gates
and a portcullis that has been left raised.  Murder holes pierce the
ceiling, and the walls are scarred where boiling oil once poured down on
attackers.  Racks of spears stand ready on either side.  The great
courtyard lies east, and the gates lead back out to the west.
