#5823
The Great Courtyard of Karras~
   The great courtyard of Karras is paved in gray stone and open to the
sky, and it is split neatly down the middle by a line of black
flagstones.  North of the line, the stones are swept clean and a
fountain plays; south of it, the ground is churned and scarred and loud
with the sound of minotaurs drilling.  Neither side seems to cross the
line if it can help it.  The courtyard continues north and south, and
the gatehouse lies west.
