#5824
The Courtyard of the Red Axe~
   This half of the courtyard belongs to the Kinthalas, the warrior clan
of Karras, and they let everyone know it: a red axe is painted on every
wall, the ground is churned by hooves and stained with old blood, and
the air rings with the clash of weapons from the fighting pit to the
east.  The barracks lie south, an armory west, and the great courtyard
north.
