The Courtyard of the White Axe~
   This half of the courtyard belongs to the Byterians, the scholar clan
of Karras.  A fountain of white marble plays here, carved with a great
white axe, and stone benches stand around it where minotaurs in gray
robes sit reading.  The cloister lies north, the library east and the
refectory west; the great courtyard lies south.
