#5826
The Kinthalas Barracks~
   Long rows of straw pallets fill this low, crowded hall, each one with
a weapon propped beside it and a sea chest at its foot.  The place reeks
of sweat, oil and wet fur.  Minotaur warriors sleep, gamble and sharpen
their axes here, and every one of them is waiting for a chance to fight
his way up the stair to the officers' quarters above.  A trapdoor leads
down to the cells, a passage runs south toward the stair, the mess hall
lies east, and the courtyard north.
