walls.  Large shelves, along the north wall, house many components in
jars of different sizes.  Several tables in the middle of the room hold
the ongoing experiments of the intelligent Byterians.  In no way does
the room have the same odor as The Spyre, but one can gather that much
of the magic taught there, is first learned here.
~
