#5880
The Officer's Quarters~
   It is readily apparent that the best Kinthalas officers live in this
room.  All equipment is sharpened, honed, polished, buffed, cleaned
and/or organized.  The area is divided up giving four officers equal
space, thus keeping the aggressive behavior directed at lower ranking
warriors.
