#5884
Private Chambers of Krommyon~
   This room is the most diverse of any held by a minotaur in Karras.
Rich tapestries and artifacts from all the Dominion decorate the room.
Many seem difficult to estimate the value of, or too bulky for
transport.  Covered candles cast various colors about the room and
incense gives the room an earthy aroma.  An interesting thing that you
notice about the room is the lack of a bed.  The only exit is back east.
~
