#5892
Bright Intersection of a Grand Hallway.~
   This grand hallway has white marble floors, which make the well lit
intersection almost unbearable.  You can tell immediately that this
place is lit with some form of magic.  The ceiling and walls along this
hall are perfectly white except where large doors are seen.  To the east
is a set of oak double doors.  To the north and south the hall
continues, though not as well lit.  A landing in the spiral stairs is to
the west.
