#5893
Intersection in a Grand Hallway~
   This is the intersection in what was once a grand hallway.  The floor
was once a beautiful red marble, but now it is marked with scratches and
chip marks.  The yellowed walls and ceiling are marked with weapon marks
and burns.  The hallway continues into the darkness of the north and
south.  A landing at spiral stairs is to the east and a steel door is on
the west wall.
