#5897
The Byterian Axe~
   The first thing you notice is the magnificent gray marble floor with
a large inlaid white marble axe in the center of the room.  The room is
bare except for three large thrones along the north wall.  From this
room, Skeiron, Kerkyon, and Prokrustes run the affairs of the Byterians.
An oak door leads west and stairs in the corner lead down.
~
