#5898
The Kinthalas Axe~
   This dimly lit room is the throne room of Krommyon, "the king" of the
Kinthalas.  A gray and red marble floor can be seen in places not
covered with furs, rugs, and other debris.  A large stone throne sits at
the north end of the room and a large apparatus with several stains
under it, sits at the south end of the room.  A steel door leads to the
east and stairs in the corner lead down.
~
