#5899
The Place of The Double Axe~
   From this room, the Byterian and Kinthalas leaders rule Karras.  A
huge granite table, runs north and south, with three identical thrones
along each side.  On the east wall, are the paintings and relics of the
Byterian, along the west the weapons and implements of the Kinthalas.
An oak door leads to the east and a steel door leads to the west.
